Restore P1 DMA-BUF BIND for buffers exported by this NPU instance.

Retain the dma_buf for the complete binding lifetime, verify the exporter and
device instance, bind only the exporter's already-owned device range into a
file-owned exec_id arena, and unwind the binding if userspace copyout fails.
This is the first deliberately narrow BIND stage; generic page-backed
exporters follow separately.

This implements the public CIX P1 BIND ABI while replacing the vendor path's
unchecked exporter-private-data access and incomplete lifetime model.

